<title>GERMANY: German Jan-July coffee imports detailed.</title>
<headline>German Jan-July coffee imports detailed.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German net green coffee imports from outside the EU totalled 6.69 million bags in January-July compared with 6.58 million a year ago period, the DKV coffee association said.</p>
<p>Imports of 992,860 bags in July were up from 900,283 in July 1995 and 876,554 bags in June 1996.</p>
<p>Colombia shipped 164,185 bags in July after 124,367 in June, El Salvador 129,184 (103,515), Indonesia 78,959 (56,540), Ethiopia 60,456 (48,746) and Kenya 60,043 (46,021).</p>
<p>Brazil was in 15th position with 29,055 bags (18,141 in June).</p>
<p>-- Hamburg newsroom +49-40-41903275</p>
